    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38078" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπανά-κλησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>recall, reaction,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπανάκλησιν θέρμης ποιέεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Aph.</u>
					5.21
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>CA</u>
				2.3
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἐ. τῶν ἀπορρεόντων μερῶν ἀπὸ τοῦ
					ὅλου εἰς αὐτὸ τὸ ὅλον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					241
				</span></i>
			; <i>call to repentance,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hierocl.
				<u>in CA</u>
				7p.429M.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>double inspiration,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				2.3.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				7.899
			</span></i>.</div>
